// S-CODE SAMPLE - OLED BITMAP AND SCROLLING
// =============================================================================
// What it does:
//   Draws a full-screen S-CPU bitmap, scrolls it left, then restores the logo.
// Expected result:
//   The 128x64 OLED shows the S-CPU logo, scrolls for five seconds, and stops.
// Runs on:
//   S-CPU TTL with a 128x64 SSD1306 OLED on the I2C bus.
// Real hardware required:
//   Yes. The OLED and I2C bus are not emulated by the software simulators.
// Demonstrates:
//   Large constant arrays, pointers, bitmap drawing, delay, and hardware scroll.
// =============================================================================
